Package: routineqc
Title: Reusable Quality Control For Routine Surveillance Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Joseph T", "Hicks", , "jthicks@imperial.ac.uk", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reusable tools for identifying likely data-entry anomalies in
    routine health facility-month surveillance data, including ANC malaria
    testing examples. The package prepares data, fits prevalence models,
    flags logical and temporal anomalies, and produces summaries for review
    and sensitivity analyses.
